WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2
File: disc02_16h.avi
Scene: Squall refuses to abandon Rinoa
Duration: approximately 15 seconds
Describes Squall's desperate determination to save Rinoa before she is sealed away forever.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Squall runs through Esthar's pristine white corridors at full speed. His expression is fierce with determination. The Ragnarok mechanic's uniform clings to his frame as he races toward the Sorceress Memorial.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
He bursts through reinforced doors. Esthar soldiers attempt to block his path, but he moves past them — nothing will stop him from reaching Rinoa.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The Ragnarok's launch sequence initiates from above. Engines power up. Squall refuses to leave without her. He will save the woman he loves, consequences be damned. The world's fear means nothing compared to his resolve.